{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：14:27 2026-05-07 HKT<br/>發佈時間：14:08 2026-05-07 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：14:08 2026-05-07 HKT</p><img alt=\"墮樓男子由消防員救下送院。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl_square/34541f4870d018cd79d424d253b84fe0/2026-05/page_64.jpg\"/><p>今日（7日）中午12時許，九龍城警區刑事調查隊在土瓜灣木廠街，調查一宗日前發生的爆竊案。其間一名40多歲男子疑見警員在場慌忙逃走，由窗口跳向對面大廈簷篷，未料跌落1B至1C號大廈的2樓簷篷受傷。救援人員接報到場，將男子由簷篷救下，送往伊利沙伯醫院搶救。</p><p>據了解，警方在場調查的爆竊案，發生於5月5日。墮樓男子手腳受傷，他獲送院時面露痛楚表情，但神智清醒。警方正調查事件。</p><img alt=\"男子由救護車送院。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/098e499b3dcef1efc7f3ad965ce14a0a/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260507_132447059.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/4a3df7c59624e6d24fed400103104e37/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260507_132447059_03.jpg\"/><img alt=\"消防員將男子救下送院。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/2eb8db66be3e26ffa05790c571a2f312/2026-05/1_11_1.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/30dd95590d5de56328de9124e1be7965/2026-05/2_7_4.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/9b6744b7e2881f2ecc667b836707e841/2026-05/3_8_0.jpg\"/><img alt=\"男子跌落簷篷，由消防員救下送院。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/730c0cfb5c33a3f088c46031ed2c23a1/2026-05/4_11_1.jpg\"/><img alt=\"消防員將墮樓男子救下。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/1f97cc5b1fe5e94dba59734b85edfc6b/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260507_132447059_05.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/04abe6645301dac72c740dfa459ff5da/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260507_132447059_09.jpg\"/><img alt=\"男子墮樓受傷。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/47f29d680c8d4ad21f57d1946f5ceb39/2026-05/1_3_14.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/319bcc9da2d289c94c9547b83cfb8e33/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260507_134122008_01.jpg\"/><img alt=\"現場是木廠街。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/d98c3daeeacf7990bb9396bf6087de90/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260507_132507712_01.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/76bacb01eed07110cf1c8bb5b55e8c59/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260507_132447059_11.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/cad2f6c14393e30bf278ff9842a67f58/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260507_132447059_12.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-07T06:42:52.483987+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":268,"images":14,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}